  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is positive in <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and negative in <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence, <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is many-one.<br />For Range of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> let <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> since <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is into</p>"
